<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. forces now operate alongside Ecuadorian troops, using MQ-9 Reaper drones redeployed from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador, while U.S. anti-drug strikes at sea seize crews and blow up boats, extending violence to the maritime domain. Ecuadorian forces captured four border commandos accused of killing soldiers and increased cooperation with Peru to combat illegal mining that funds organized crime. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation led to 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust, and nightly curfews are imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a declared state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQOFNadFNYUmxmMWNMeTRqdzc5aWhiTjVxOUxNWUppZjFoYzlHRkhBUWFFTmFDNF90VEowRTd0TGR2ZW1pWW1seUFlSUpMYTVkTzljdEVGVDFjRXBfak9fZm5iSEJ6UjlYbjI2YThveWw5NlpBY1M3ZU9zTFdJNEVqakI3Vnc0aThuU2xCWGtxckh5ZC1XOVlOb2FMMlRILWFVV3lsRDlHUW9teXJLSEhJQ0FWVkpPUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOa2F3LWJ6X2JsMUJCbmtaVy1wanVPODZ1cllabmJUdlZqd3ItUXNvdUM5ZkxHcEVjdnhxZmtIbkRzdnRyemt3MGlkaWxVX1hpNDRzUlpfT19wMU4yU3RxVW5lTVhmU19OcEoxNVdwdEtwZ3dDdVhmVXBUdFNvLVE0NFlPc3ZWNnZKOW9JeXRIdzZyWTdxZjByeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNb3hXWWlIU2JrQkpFUXJSRmRRM3ZSeTZNYWVYRGw3Uk1lVEZBZzk4QTFBVmFfRWlNZHE3TElGUDlvN29CdFVnbnhVTGh1Z3YyUWZvY2RSeFNJT0VxekFfNWEwRkRCcmcwS0lPOEZrNGpYRW1sWENqaV9laW13b2FMZEhFR19IZWNrXzN5ZzZRbEpWZXlSUWxZb2ladkNZTjJOcFRvWl91dGMyZGdoTWFqUmZ5cHJLYkJINHNJZXlDRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Goshen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95c